@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Cotización válida → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": {
    "name": "Ana Pérez",
    "email": "Ana@Empresa.com",
    "company": "Empresa SA"
  },
  "comment": "Necesitamos logo bordado",
  "privacyAccepted": true,
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 100 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 50 }
  ]
}

### Mismo email, sin empresa → reutiliza el contacto y conserva la empresa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": { "name": "Ana Pérez", "email": "ana@empresa.com" },
  "privacyAccepted": true,
  "items": [{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 20 }]
}

### Datos inválidos → 400 con detalle por campo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": { "name": "", "email": "no-es-un-email" },
  "privacyAccepted": false,
  "items": []
}

### Producto inexistente → 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": { "name": "Juan", "email": "juan@test.com" },
  "privacyAccepted": true,
  "items": [{ "productId": 9999, "quantity": 1 }]
}